 ## Background
-Originated in the context of point-based rendering and EWA filtering approximations. It was proposed as a new approximation between the optimal EWA resampling filter and the approximation of Botsch et al. [BHZK05] to dynamically adjust tangent vectors in object space [S1]. The method acknowledges that its approximation can be coarse when a splat experiences minification in one direction and magnification in another, where fine parts may still fall between image samples [S1].
